// Test sheet W-01: a billboard in front of the fan wall.
//
// The board is all area and little mass: the wind on it, 9 m up, is what
// the tower has to carry, and gusts make it sway. It is bolted to a base
// frame; tear the bolts or let it swing too far and the test fails.
